I identified the core alignment issue: the harness compares against the model’s *delayed* internal buffer/polarity (`*_delayed`), so the DUT-visible `proc_buffer_*_dff` and `proc_pol_dff` must be one cycle behind the current computed values. I’m adding an explicit one-cycle stage for `proc_buffer_*_dff` and restoring the 2-stage polarity path.
