codex
I’ve identified the mismatch: the model compares against a one-cycle delayed buffer (`proc_buffer_*_dff_delayed`), but RTL currently exposes the immediate buffer value combinationally. I’m applying a minimal fix by registering `proc_buffer_i_dff/proc_buffer_q_dff` as an explicit delay stage.
